   "id": "gemm-int8-vs-f16",
   "title": "int8-quantized GEMM (Vulkan) vs f16 tensor-core GEMM (CUDA)",
   "applies_to": "vulkan vs cuda, prefill GEMM on quantized weight types",
   "mechanism": "Vulkan takes the int8 MMQ path for types its policy allows (src/vulkan/mod.rs:819); sm_70 CUDA always takes the f16 path because `i8_gemm` is false on Volta (src/cuda/mod.rs:558). X is quantized to int8 per 32 elements on one side and rounded to f16 on the other, so the two GEMMs multiply different numbers.",
   "measured": "3.17e-3 .. 4.08e-3 relative L2 per-op (docs/V100-results.md:303-310)",
   "arm": "STRATA_MMQ= forces the f16 GEMM on Vulkan and isolates this entry",
   "follow_up": "M3-T5 (Vulkan parity gap, docs/ROADMAP.md:351)"
  },
